  },
  {
    "ref": "U00209",
    "text": "- paragraph [ref=e194]: With MORE COLORS than anyone, Sprinkle Pop’s bespoke sprinkle mixes are sure to be the POP that your baked goods need to perfectly coordinate with any event."
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00210",
    "text": "- paragraph [ref=e195]: Bell of the Ball Princess sprinkle mix is a mixture of warm yellows and golds, with a pop of red. Our royal icing roses ad the finishing touch!"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00211",
    "text": "- paragraph [ref=e196]:"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00212",
    "text": "- generic [ref=e197]: \"* Please note that the royal icing rose pieces make up a small percentage of the sprinkle mix. As a point of reference, you may expect to see 6-8 pieces in a 4 oz bottle. A 2oz sample size bag may only have 2-4 pieces. Please select your size accordingly.\""
