  },
  {
    "ref": "U00242",
    "text": "- paragraph [ref=e239]: Contains SOY, MILK, and WHEAT"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00243",
    "text": "- paragraph [ref=e240]: (This list is not intended to address all substances that may represent an allergen risk to certain individuals.)"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00244",
    "text": "- paragraph [ref=e241]: This product is prepared and packaged using machines that may come into contact with WHEAT, EGGS, MILK, SOY, and TREE NUTS. Unintentional cross contamination can always be a possibility, however remote."
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00245",
    "text": "- generic [ref=e242]:"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00246",
    "text": "- heading \"Ingredients\" [level=4] [ref=e243]"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00247",
    "text": "- paragraph [ref=e244]: Beeswax, calcium sulfate, carnauba wax, cocoa, confectioner's glaze, corn starch, corn syrup, dextrin, dextrose, egg whites (EGGS), glucose powder, glycerin, gum arabic, hpmc, hydrogenated palm kernel oil, lecithin (SOY), magnesium silicate, mica based pearlescent pigment"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00248",
    "text": "- heading \"Ingredients (cont.)\" [level=5] [ref=e245]"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00249",
    "text": "- paragraph [ref=e246]: natural and artificial flavors, palm kernel fat, potassium acid tartrate, reduced protein whey (MILK), salt, silicon dioxide, sugar, tapioca dextrin, tapioca starch, vanilla, blue 2 (E133), gold (e175), iron oxide (e172), red 3 (e127), red 40 (e129), titanium dioxide (e171), yellow 5 (e102), yellow 6 (e110), citric acid, and less than 1/10 of 1% sodium benzoate"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00250",
    "text": "- generic [ref=e249]:"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00251",
    "text": "- paragraph [ref=e250]: \"Warning: Our Metallic Sprinkle Mixes contain silver and/or gold dragee pieces which are sugar coated in a non-toxic silver & gold food color. These colors have been released for consumption in the EU & Canada, but have not yet been evaluated by the USA FDA. For this reason they are labeled \\\"For Decorative Use Only\\\"\""
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00252",
    "text": "- paragraph [ref=e251]: Metallic dragees can be hard, please consume with caution"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00253",
    "text": "- paragraph [ref=e252]: \"*While we take great care in packaging our products, breakage does happen from time to time. Royal Icing pieces are very fragile.\""
  },
