  {
    "ref": "U00258",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e258]: Bell Of The Ball Princess is a mixture of Yellow Gold Red and Royal red rose Icing for girls occasion"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00259",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e259]: Perfect Sprinkles for decorating party themed cakes, cupcakes, cookies, donuts, ice creams and more! Guaranteed for 18 months. Store in a cool, dark place [such as your pantry]"
  },
  {
    "ref": "U00260",
    "text": "- listitem [ref=e260]: Our Sprinkles make fun and wonderful decorations for edible baked treats, Ice cream and candy for baby showers, Gender reveal, birthdays, bridal showers, weddings, valentines, Easter, Independence day, halloween, Thanksgiving, Christmas Holiday occasion and all party events!"
  },
  {
